# Firebase hands the FCM V1 service-account key out under ITS name, not ours
# (agbc-app-firebase-adminsdk-<hash>-<hash>.json), which the pattern above does
# not match. Added W3.3 2026-08-16: this file is a live server credential, and
# the repo has already had one secret-scanning alert (credentials.md 2026-07-25).
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
