# Local tooling / MCP config (machine-specific)
.mcp.json
.figma-verify/

# Any `eas`/`expo` command run from the REPO ROOT (rather than apps/mobile) finds no
# Expo config, offers to "configure this project", and drops a stub `{"expo":{}}` here.
# It then shadows apps/mobile/app.config.js for every later root-run command, which once
# nearly wrote the EAS project id into a directory with no app in it (W3.3, 2026-08-16).
# Deleted twice, recreated twice; ignored now so it can never be committed.
/app.json

# Generated review packets and store screenshots (W4.8). Both are DERIVED: the
# packets come from the locale files (`node scripts/build-review-packet.mjs de`)
# and the screenshots from a real device. Committing either would create a file
# that drifts from the app in silence, which is the one thing a reviewer packet
# must not do. Generate them fresh when you send them.
docs/store/review-packet-*.md
docs/store/screenshots/
